Business Insights:
Insight 1:
Health & Beauty products generated the highest revenue among all categories.

Recommendation: Increase inventory and marketing campaigns for Health & Beauty products.

Insight 2:
Sales reached their peak during November.

Recommendation: Launch festive promotions and discount campaigns during November.

Insight 3:
São Paulo contributed the highest revenue.

Recommendation: Focus regional advertising and logistics investments in São Paulo.

Insight 4:
Average Order Value is relatively high.

Recommendation: Introduce product bundles and upselling strategies.

Insight 5:
Most customers provided 5-star ratings.

Recommendation: Maintain customer service quality and delivery efficiency.
